{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/068-yang-zhi-shui/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/068-yang-zhi-shui/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 揚之水 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 王風 · 揚之水 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《揚之水》的 11 条注释，含 11 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"068-yang-zhi-shui","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/068-yang-zhi-shui/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"068-yang-zhi-shui","title":"揚之水","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"wangfeng","path":["風","王風","揚之水"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"揚之水","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"不流束薪","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"彼其之子","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"不與我戍申","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"懷哉懷哉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"曷月予還歸哉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"揚之水","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"不流束楚","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"彼其之子","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"不與我戍甫","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"懷哉懷哉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"曷月予還歸哉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"揚之水","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"不流束蒲","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"彼其之子","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"不與我戍許","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"懷哉懷哉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"曷月予還歸哉","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":11,"glossCount":11},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":11,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"揚之水㊟戍卒怨也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标题段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":11,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《揚之水》三章，章六句。經文明明言戍申、戍甫、戍許，而《序》偏云「戍于母家」，致啟《集傳》忘讐逆理之論，是皆未嘗即當日形勢而一思之耳。夫周轍既東，楚實强盛。京洛形勢，左據成臯，右控崤函，背枕黄河，面俯嵩高。則申、甫、許實爲南服屏蔽。而三國又非楚敵，不得不戍重兵以相保守，然後東都可以立國。觀於三國吴、魏相持，兩家重鎮必屯襄、樊，則往事可知。平王此時，不申、甫、許之是戍而何戍耶？其所以致民怨嗟、見諸歌咏而不已者，以徵調不均，瓜代又難必耳。夫徵調不均，則勞逸異勢；瓜代難必，則生聚無期。不惟小民怨咨，亦足見秉國者之措置乖方，籌謀未善。若宗周形勝，則豈慮是哉？此東都之不再振而西轍之難歸者，有由然矣。若沾沾謂其篤於母家，致令久戍不歸，則何異小兒夢囈！不識時務之甚。吾恐平王君臣，竊相笑於地下也。","targetNotes":"通篇总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"揚悠揚也，水緩流之貌。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"彼其之子〔案〕姚氏際恒曰：鄭氏謂「處鄉里者」，歐陽氏謂「國人怨諸侯不戍申」，皆可通。《集傳》謂「指室家」，則謬矣。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"戍屯兵以守也。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0006","order":6,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"申〔梁氏益曰〕申，伯爵，初爲侯，平王母申姜國，楚靈王遷之。今信陽之方城内也。〔《皇輿表》〕鄧州屬南陽府，信陽軍屬汝甯府，並隸河南。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0006-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0007","order":7,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"楚木也。〔陸氏佃曰〕楚者，楚地所出，其一名荆，故楚入《春秋》稱荆，而荆州亦以此木得名。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0007-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0008","order":8,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"甫〔《集傳》〕甫，即吕也，亦姜姓。《書》「吕刑」，《禮記》作「甫刑」。而孔氏以爲吕侯後爲甫侯，是也。〔王氏應麟曰〕《史記》：「吕尚先祖爲四岳，佐禹治水有功，虞、夏之際受封於吕。」《括地志》：「故吕城在鄧州南陽縣西四十里。」《吕氏春秋》：「吕在宛縣西。」","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0008-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0009","order":9,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"蒲〔嚴氏粲曰〕毛以爲草，鄭以爲蒲柳，皆通。〔案〕「蒲草」見《陳·澤陂》，「蒲柳」見《陳·東門之楊》。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0009-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0010","order":10,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"許〔《集傳》〕許，國名，亦姜姓，今潁昌府許昌縣是也。〔《皇輿表》〕潁昌府許昌縣，今開封許州，隸河南。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0010-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0011","order":11,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"標韻薪十一真。申同。本韻。懷九佳。歸五微。轉韻。楚六語。甫七麌。通韻。蒲七麌，叶滂左反。許六語。叶韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0011-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵"}]}]}}}
